sections.Overview:
Early Missions
"He who desires peace should prepare for war."  --Anonymous

You have been chosen to lead the people of Nimbus to
victory against their oppressors.  Are you prepared
to fight with every ounce of your strength and will?

$Checked=1 Bridge the Gap,MissionBegin,Tutorial1,{DoneTutorial1},1
$Checked=2 Secret Workshop,MissionBegin,Tutorial2,{DoneTutorial2},{DoneTutorial1}
$Checked=3 Capture The Priest,MissionBegin,Tutorial3,{DoneTutorial3},{DoneTutorial2}
